<h1>Reset your password</h1>

<p>Hi<%= " #{@user.name}" if @user.name.present? %>,</p>

<p>We received a request to reset the password for your Inventory
account. Choose a new password here:</p>

<p><a href="<%= @url %>">Reset my password</a></p>

<p>If the button doesn't work, paste this link into your browser:</p>

<p><%= @url %></p>

<p>This link expires in <%= @ttl_hours %> hours. If you didn't request a
password reset, you can ignore this email — your password won't change.</p>
